@startuml OrderManagementUseCase

left to right direction
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor LightSkyBlue
}

actor "卖家" as Seller <<主要参与者>>
actor "买家" as Buyer <<次要参与者>>
actor "财务系统" as FinanceSystem <<外部系统>>
actor "库存系统" as InventorySystem <<外部系统>>

' 核心订单管理用况
usecase "审核新订单" as ReviewNewOrder
usecase "执行订单发货" as ExecuteOrderShipment
usecase "处理售后服务" as ProcessAfterSales
usecase "管理订单查询" as ManageOrderInquiry

' 审核新订单的扩展用况
usecase "处理库存不足" as HandleStockShortage
usecase "验证服务可行性" as ValidateServiceFeasibility
usecase "审核高风险订单" as ReviewHighRiskOrder
usecase "联系买家确认" as ContactBuyerConfirmation

' 执行订单发货的扩展用况
usecase "安排物流配送" as ArrangeLogistics
usecase "处理部分发货" as HandlePartialShipment
usecase "处理订单修改" as HandleOrderModification
usecase "处理加急订单" as HandleUrgentOrder

' 处理售后服务的扩展用况
usecase "处理退款申请" as ProcessRefundRequest
usecase "处理换货申请" as ProcessExchangeRequest
usecase "处理客户投诉" as HandleCustomerComplaint
usecase "处理商品维修" as HandleProductRepair

' 管理订单查询的扩展用况
usecase "查询订单状态" as QueryOrderStatus
usecase "追踪物流信息" as TrackLogisticsInfo
usecase "查看订单历史" as ViewOrderHistory

' 可复用功能（包含关系）
usecase "发送通知" as SendNotification
usecase "更新库存" as UpdateInventory
usecase "记录操作日志" as RecordOperationLog

' 参与者与核心用况关系
Seller --> ReviewNewOrder
Seller --> ExecuteOrderShipment
Seller --> ProcessAfterSales
Seller --> ManageOrderInquiry

Buyer --> ManageOrderInquiry
Buyer --> ProcessAfterSales

FinanceSystem --> ProcessAfterSales
InventorySystem --> ReviewNewOrder
InventorySystem --> ExecuteOrderShipment

' 审核新订单的扩展关系
ReviewNewOrder <.. HandleStockShortage : <<extend>>\n当商品库存不足时
ReviewNewOrder <.. ValidateServiceFeasibility : <<extend>>\n当有特殊服务要求时
ReviewNewOrder <.. ReviewHighRiskOrder : <<extend>>\n当订单金额超过5000元时
ReviewNewOrder <.. ContactBuyerConfirmation : <<extend>>\n当信息不完整或存疑时

' 执行订单发货的扩展关系
ExecuteOrderShipment <.. ArrangeLogistics : <<extend>>\n当订单审核通过时
ExecuteOrderShipment <.. HandlePartialShipment : <<extend>>\n当商品部分有货时
ExecuteOrderShipment <.. HandleOrderModification : <<extend>>\n当买家要求修改时
ExecuteOrderShipment <.. HandleUrgentOrder : <<extend>>\n当标记为加急订单时

' 处理售后服务的扩展关系
ProcessAfterSales <.. ProcessRefundRequest : <<extend>>\n当客户申请退款时
ProcessAfterSales <.. ProcessExchangeRequest : <<extend>>\n当客户要求换货时
ProcessAfterSales <.. HandleCustomerComplaint : <<extend>>\n当收到客户投诉时
ProcessAfterSales <.. HandleProductRepair : <<extend>>\n当商品需要维修时

' 管理订单查询的扩展关系
ManageOrderInquiry <.. QueryOrderStatus : <<extend>>\n当查询订单进度时
ManageOrderInquiry <.. TrackLogisticsInfo : <<extend>>\n当追踪包裹位置时
ManageOrderInquiry <.. ViewOrderHistory : <<extend>>\n当查看历史记录时

' 包含关系（可复用功能）
ReviewNewOrder ..> SendNotification : <<include>>
ExecuteOrderShipment ..> SendNotification : <<include>>
ProcessAfterSales ..> SendNotification : <<include>>

ExecuteOrderShipment ..> UpdateInventory : <<include>>
ProcessAfterSales ..> UpdateInventory : <<include>>

ReviewNewOrder ..> RecordOperationLog : <<include>>
ExecuteOrderShipment ..> RecordOperationLog : <<include>>
ProcessAfterSales ..> RecordOperationLog : <<include>>

note right of ReviewNewOrder
**羽毛球专卖特色**
• 穿线服务可行性评估
• 球拍规格专业验证
• 高价值商品风险控制
• 定制要求技术确认
end note

note right of ExecuteOrderShipment
**专业物流管理**
• 球拍特殊包装处理
• 比赛用品加急配送
• 分批发货库存协调
• 物流信息实时更新
end note

note right of ProcessAfterSales
**专业售后服务**
• 穿线质量争议处理
• 球拍真伪鉴定支持
• 专业维修服务协调
• 使用问题技术指导
end note

legend right
| 业务范围说明 |
| 核心订单流程管理 |
| 专业羽毛球器材特色 |
| 实用的扩展场景处理 |
endlegend

@enduml